    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Abrahamu yaashwera ondiijo mukazi orikwetwa Ketura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaazaara nawe Zimuraani, Yokishaani, Medani, Midiani, Ishibaaki na Shua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yokishaani yaazaara Sheeba na Dedani. Kandi beene Dedani n'aba Ashuri n'aba Letushi n'aba Leumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abaana ba Midiani ni Efa, Eferi, Hanoki, Abida na Elidaa. Abo boona n'oruzaaro rwa Ketura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu yaaha Isaaka ebye byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka abaana b'ebinyanshunju bye ebi yaabaire aine, yaabaha ebiconco. Bwanyima yaaboohereza akiriho, ngu bataane n'omwana we Isaaka; baatoora oburugwa-izooba, baahika omu nsi y'obwo bukiizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyaka ei Abrahamu yaahikize ekaba eri igana na makumi mushanju n'etaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu ku yaahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru, omwitsyo gwamuhwamu, yaafa gye ari omugurusi w'emyaka mingi, yaakurata baishenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.50.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 50:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Isaaka na Ishimaeli abatabani baamuziika omu nyanga ya Makipeela omu kibanja kya Efurooni mwene Zohari Omuhiiti, aharikureeba Mamure, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekibanja eki Abrahamu yaaguzire ahari beene Heesi. Aho niho Abrahamu yaaziikirwe hamwe na Saara omukazi we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima y'okufa kwa Abrahamu Ruhanga yaaha Isaaka omwana we omugisha. Isaaka yaatuura Beeri-lahairoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa Ishimaeli mwene Abrahamu, ou yaazaire ahari Hagari Omunyamisrikazi, omuzaana wa Saara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi aga nigo maziina ga beene Ishimaeli, nk'oku baakurataine. Omujigaijo gwa Ishimaeli ni Nebayoosi; haataho Kedari, Adubeeli, Mibusamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mishuma, Duma, Masa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadi, Teema, Yetura, Nafishi na Kedema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo nibo batabani ba Ishimaeli, kandi ago nigo maziina gaabo, omu birorero byabo n'omu maka gaabo abategyeki ikumi na babiri nk'amahanga gaabo oku gaabaire gari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyaka ei Ishimaeli yaahikize ekaba igana na makumi ashatu na mushanju; yaahwamu omwitsyo, yaafa, yaakurata baishenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatura okuruga Havila okuhika Shuuri eri omu maisho ga Misri, nootoora Asiria. Kandi Ishimaeli yaatuura beene ishe boona hangahari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa Isaaka mwene Abrahamu. Abrahamu akazaara Isaaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaka ku yaahikize emyaka makumi ana, yaashwera Rebeka muhara wa Besueli Omusiria wa Padanaramu, munyaanya wa Labaani Omusiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaka yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA ahabw'omukazi we, ahakuba akaba ari engumba; MUKAMA yaahurira okweshengyereza kwe, Rebeka omukazi we yaagira enda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.9.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 9:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abaana baamurwanira omunda; yaagira ati: Ku kiraabe kiri kiti, ngumiireho ki? Yaayehanuuza ahari MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro bye eby'okuzaara ku byahikire, yaashangwa aine enda y'empasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuru yaazaarwa naatukura, aine obwoya aha mubiri gwe gwona nk'omwenda gw'ebyoya; baamweta Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 12:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Haakurataho Kato, omukono gwe gukwaitse ekitsintsiino kya Esau; baamweta Yakobo. Obwo Isaaka akaba ahikize emyaka makumi mukaaga, obu omukazi we yaabazaara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo boojo baakura; Esau yaaba omuhiigi w'obwengye ruraaramahamba; Yakobo yaaba omucureezi, yaaguma omuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
